# A name bound to what the language's own code computes of names, with no call, stands for those names (#328): `named`
# binds the gap between the two levels (`first.db - second.db`) and the list of both (`[first, second]`) to names before
# it hands each to a step, and `written` writes each where its step is handed it. An operator is no occurrence and a
# name adds no arrow, so the two routes are one plan: each step takes the two levels, and no value of the body's own
# (`gap`, `both`) stands between them and the step.

route signal.named
step named/_draw
step named/_show

line entry > named call
line Level·first > named value
line Level·second > named value
line Level·first > named/_draw value                 # `_draw(gap)`, `gap = first.db - second.db`
line Level·second > named/_draw value
line Level·first > named/_show value                 # `_show(both)`, `both = [first, second]`
line Level·second > named/_show value
line named/_draw > Screen own
line named/_show > Screen own

home Level·first named
home Level·second named

side entry left
side Screen right

route signal.written
step written/_draw
step written/_show

line entry > written call
line Level·first > written value
line Level·second > written value
line Level·first > written/_draw value               # `_draw(first.db - second.db)`
line Level·second > written/_draw value
line Level·first > written/_show value               # `_show([first, second])`
line Level·second > written/_show value
line written/_draw > Screen own
line written/_show > Screen own

home Level·first written
home Level·second written

side entry left
side Screen right

# `gathered` writes the list of both levels out once (`[first, second]`): it stands for them, so the step that shows it
# takes the two levels.

route signal.gathered
step gathered/_show

line entry > gathered call
line Level·first > gathered value
line Level·second > gathered value
line Level·first > gathered/_show value              # `_show(both)`, `both: list[Level] = [first, second]`
line Level·second > gathered/_show value
line gathered/_show > Screen own

home Level·first gathered
home Level·second gathered

side entry left
side Screen right
